  "source_history": {
    "creation": "The municipal physical plaque, 2019 visitor and 2020 religious record give 1869. Some later secondary lists give 1870.",
    "destroyed_and_rebuilt": "Fire in 1917 according to the 2019 journal. The rebuilt three-bay main hall and two wings date after the fire; the initial foundation date does not date the standing timber. Twentieth-century repair and reopening are documented in the 1980s.",
    "repairs": "The religious history gives permission to reopen February 1983 and a 1985 consecration. It separately identifies the 1984 inscription above the west entry.",
    "later_cover": "The 2019 photographs and architectural article show a later glass/steel canopy enclosing the court. Its installation date is unknown. The 2026 imagery edition shows work and a changed covering; no contemporary survey requested or implied.",
    "secondary_compound": "In 2001 the former education bureau building and court at 方浜中路593号 (832 m²) was exchanged to the monastery. This gray arched-window house and the lower yellow street entrance remain beyond the modeled main court.",
    "director_axis": "The northern main hall faces the court to the south, the gate hall stands across the court to the south, wings adjoin east and west. Entry into the main compound from 榛岭街 historically faces west.",
